{
  "articles": [
    {
      "title": "豆瓣8.6，这本书让我不再害怕被讨厌",
      "thumb_media_id": "AePEmFk8ZwibHEAn_R1JIf7-dJMORosCI0FFKDIrQs9HgIHuk_DS-fWxVU2IgiYu",
      "content": "<div style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 40px 10px; font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; letter-spacing: 0.3px; box-sizing: border-box\">\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">大家好，我是马尔斯，书灯笔记的主理人。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你有没有过这种时刻：明明不想去，但还是答应了朋友的饭局；明明被冒犯了，却笑着说&quot;没关系&quot;；明明累得不行，还是不敢拒绝领导临时加的任务。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你不是善良，你是害怕。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">害怕被讨厌，害怕让别人失望，害怕关系破裂。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这种恐惧像一根隐形的绳子，把你绑得死死的，你越挣扎，它勒得越紧。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">今天想跟你聊聊《被讨厌的勇气》。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">01 一切烦恼，都来自人际关系</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这本书的作者岸见一郎和古贺史健，用对话的形式把阿德勒心理学讲了一遍。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">阿德勒跟弗洛伊德、荣格并称心理学三巨头，但他的理论有个很不一样的起点。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">弗洛伊德说，你的问题来自过去，来自童年创伤。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">阿德勒说，<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">你的问题来自你现在的关系，而且你有能力改变它。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这句话听起来好像没什么，但你细品。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">如果问题来自过去，那你就是个受害者，只能被分析、被疗愈、被治愈。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">但如果问题来自现在的关系，那你就有选择权——你可以选择怎么回应，选择跟谁保持距离，选择做什么样的人。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">阿德勒有个很狠的判断：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">一切烦恼都是人际关系的烦恼。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你嫌自己长得不够好看——是因为你在跟别人比较。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你焦虑收入不够高——是因为你在意别人的评价。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你害怕独处——是因为你觉得一个人代表&quot;没人要&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">甚至孤独这种看似跟别人无关的感受，也是因为你在渴望连接。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这不是让你去怪别人。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">恰恰相反，这是告诉你：既然烦恼的根源在关系里，那解药也在关系里——但前提是，你得先搞清楚，哪些关系是你该负责的，哪些不是。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 32px;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">02 课题分离：别为别人的情绪买单</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">阿德勒最实用的一个概念叫&quot;课题分离&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">意思是：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">分清楚什么是你的课题，什么是别人的课题，然后只管自己的。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">举个例子。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你跟同事提了一个方案，同事不高兴了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">你的课题是什么？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">是把方案提清楚、提专业。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">同事高不高兴，那是同事的课题，不是你的。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">听起来简单对吧？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">但大多数人做不到。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">因为我们从小被教育&quot;要顾及别人的感受&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这句话本身没错，但很多人把它理解成了&quot;别人的感受就是我的责任&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">同事不高兴，是我的错；爸妈失望，是我的错；朋友不开心，我应该去哄。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">这不是善良，这是越界。</strong></p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">阿德勒说得很直白：你不能强迫别人怎么想，别人也不能强迫你怎么做。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">每个人都要为自己的情绪和选择负责。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">我以前是个典型的讨好型人格。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">开会的时候，明明觉得领导的想法有问题，但看到其他人都在点头，我就跟着点。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">回到家才后悔：我刚才为什么不说话？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">后来我想明白了一件事——<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">我不表达真实想法，不是因为我尊重别人，是因为我害怕冲突。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 这两件事看起来一样，本质完全不同。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">尊重别人是&quot;我听到了你的观点，我有不同看法，但我愿意听你说完&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">害怕冲突是&quot;我不同意你，但我不敢说&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">前者是勇气，后者是懦弱。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n</section>\n<section style=\"background-color: #ffffff; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.02) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 22px 22px; border: 1px solid rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.1); box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(45, 52, 54, 0.08), 0 0 20px rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.2); border-radius: 16px; padding: 28px; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; \"><h2 style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; margin: 32px 0 16px 0; padding: 12px 20px; background-color: #2c3e50; border-radius: 6px;\">03 被讨厌的勇气，不是让你当混蛋</h2>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">说到这里，可能有人会觉得：那我是不是可以想说什么就说什么，别人生气了关我什么事？</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">不是的。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">阿德勒从来没说过&quot;不要在意别人&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">他说的是：<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">不要把别人的评价当成你活着的标准。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">这两个东西差别很大。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">&quot;不在意别人&quot;是冷漠，是自我中心。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">&quot;不把别人的评价当标准&quot;是清醒——你知道自己是谁，你要什么，你愿意为什么付出代价。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">被讨厌的勇气，不是让你去得罪人，而是让你在&quot;做自己&quot;和&quot;讨好别人&quot;之间，不再无条件地选择后者。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">说实话，这个道理我听了很久才真正理解。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">我之前一直觉得，如果所有人都喜欢我，那我一定是个好人。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">后来发现，<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">如果所有人都喜欢你，大概率是因为你从来没有表达过真实的自己。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\"></strong> 一个没有棱角的人，确实不会得罪任何人，但也很难真正被任何人记住。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">阿德勒说，人有两种自由：一种是什么都不做的自由，另一种是&quot;被讨厌的自由&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">前一种很容易，躺平就行。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">后一种很难，因为它意味着你要站出来，要表达，要承担被误解、被拒绝的风险。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">但只有拥有后一种自由的人，才真正活过。</p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">读完这本书，我做了一个小实验：连续一周，在别人提出不合理要求的时候，温和但坚定地说&quot;不&quot;。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">第一天的感觉是恐惧。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">第二天是愧疚。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">第三天开始，有点爽。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">我发现，那些我以为会因此讨厌我的人，并没有离开。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">而那些真正在意我的人，反而更尊重我了。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">原来，<strong style=\"color: #34495e; font-weight: 700;\">你不需要被所有人喜欢，你只需要被对的人喜欢。</strong></p>\n<hr style=\"border: none; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(44, 62, 80, 0.3), transparent);\" />\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">书灯笔记，用一本书，点亮一盏灯。</p>\n<p style=\"font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #2d3436; margin: 0 0 16px 0; text-align: justify;\">我是马尔斯，我们下期见。</p>\n</section>\n</div>",
      "author": "马尔斯",
      "digest": "你不是善良，你是害怕。阿德勒的《被讨厌的勇气》告诉你：一切烦恼都是人际关系的烦恼，而课题分离是获得自由的关键。",
